WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,420
Has the Oligar Hotel been officially included? I'm looking inside.

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:06,180
Not a single zombie is too good

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,780
The superpower base is too far away from me

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,100
It's too dangerous to rush there.

5
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:11,220
This hotel has a lot to offer

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,060
Have you ever gone together as a team?

7
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:17,430
I'm a little scared myself, are you sure?

8
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:19,070
What are the admission requirements for this stronghold?

9
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,390
Isn't it also detecting superpowers?

10
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:23,930
Ordinary abilities went to the white area, right?

11
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:25,910
Have you taken the risk?

12
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:27,510
What should I do if I don’t accept it again?

13
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,220
too dangerous

14
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,100
Hotel Olligar

15
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,980
It's not an official handwriting

16
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,060
These guys can clear out an entire hotel

17
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,220
We also successfully reinforced the metal armor on the periphery.

18
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:39,420
This demonstrated strength cannot be underestimated.

19
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:40,660
As an exploration team

20
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,940
I have to go to the meeting to meet with the person in charge of this base to find out the details.

21
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,180
Then report to the official

22
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:47,830
How is everyone?

23
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:49,390
Basically everything is fine

24
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:50,670
Fortunately, Zhixuanxiang

25
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:51,830
Basically almost as good

26
00:00:51,830 --> 00:00:53,470
I also reinforced the stronghold outside.

27
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:55,070
It is difficult for people with strange powers to enter

28
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:57,470
But I'll still go out looking for supplies and gold rivers

29
00:00:57,750 --> 00:00:58,790
during my absence

30
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:00,190
The stronghold is quite dangerous.
